Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did India quietly lend America
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,38.4 billion dollars this summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.99,0:00:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cousin abroad earns dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He parks them in an Indian
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,bank as a dollar FD,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,called FCNR.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,RBI made it sweeter with a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,special offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dollars poured in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His savings dodge a falling rupee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,India's dollar safe gets fuller.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But dollars cannot sit idle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So India lent them to America,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,through US government bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why care?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,India imports about 88 percent of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,its crude oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.89,0:00:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A full dollar safe keeps the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,rupee steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That special window has closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Experts say this buying may slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not investment advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.65,0:00:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to your cousin abroad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,who keeps his savings in dollars.
